### Configure Next.js for SPA Output

Source: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/v16.2.9/docs/01-app/02-guides/migrating/from-create-react-app.mdx

Create a `next.config.ts` file at the project root to configure Next.js. The `output: 'export'` option enables static export for a Single-Page Application (SPA), and `distDir` changes the build output directory.

```typescript
import type { NextConfig } from 'next'

const nextConfig: NextConfig = {
  output: 'export', // Outputs a Single-Page Application (SPA)
  distDir: 'build', // Changes the build output directory to `build`
}

export default nextConfig
```

