### Create (table creation)

Source: https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws/blob/main/internal/service/dynamodb/table.go

During table creation, reads the argument and passes it as `DeletionProtectionEnabled` to the AWS API.

```go
if v, ok := d.GetOk("deletion_protection_enabled"); ok {
	input.DeletionProtectionEnabled = aws.Bool(v.(bool))
}
